    "evidence": "Keyboard coverage and visible focus passed for all expected controls at every viewport; no touch-target or page-overflow violations were measured, and reduced-motion sampling found no moving elements. However, WCAG contrast remains unproven: axe returned serious incomplete contrast checks for 28 desktop and 10 tablet/mobile arena nodes, notably the small SVG chart labels. Header contrast was also incomplete on tablet/mobile. Therefore an 8 is not evidence-supported.",
